  "contentType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>Pips · Your own trading squad</title><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://getpips.xyz/\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Five little pips that hunt, copy, snipe and guard for you. The Hunter shows who is worth following with the evidence; nothing runs until you approve it. Same-slot fills.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#06080E\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Pips · Your own trading squad\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Five little pips that hunt, copy, snipe and guard for you. Same-slot fills.\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://getpips.xyz/art/og.jpg\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://getpips.xyz/\"><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Pips\"><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://getpips.xyz/art/og.jpg\"><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@pipsonsol\"><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/art/icon-32.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"64x64\" href=\"/art/icon-64.png\"><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/art/icon-180.png\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\"><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/fonts/bricolage.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/fonts/satoshi-400.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/pips.css?v=1014r\">\n<script src=\"/js/app.js?v=1017a\" defer></script><script src=\"/js/world.js?v=1014g\" defer></script><script src=\"/js/slotchart.js?v=1014g\" defer></script><script src=\"/js/landing.js?v=1018b\" defer></script><script type=\"module\" src=\"/js/hero3d.js?v=1014g\"></script><script src=\"/js/proof.js?v=1017b\" defer></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/hero3d.css?v=1014g\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/proof.css?v=1014g\">\n</head><body class=\"landing\">\n<main>\n  <!-- the stage: the squad's room at night on a living dot field, the platform's real events running under it -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <canvas class=\"dots\" id=\"dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"wrap hero-copy\">\n      <div class=\"kicker pillk rise\" style=\"--i:0\"><span class=\"led\"></span>Live<span class=\"wide-only\"> on the market</span> · you approve every move</div>\n      <h1 class=\"rise\" style=\"--i:1\">Your own <em>trading squad.</em></h1>\n      <p class=\"lead rise\" style=\"--i:2\">Five little pips that hunt, copy, snipe and guard while you sleep, and act only on what you approve.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta rise\" style=\"--i:3\"><a class=\"btn ink lg\" href=\"https://scope.getpips.xyz\">Open the app</a><a class=\"btn lg ghost\" href=\"#hero3d\" id=\"talk-go\">Talk to the squad</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- the squad in 3D (js/hero3d.js + squadstage.js + pip3d.js): they live, they talk; click one and write to it. The 2D room is the fallback without WebGL -->\n    <div class=\"hero-room hero-3d rise\" style=\"--i:4\" id=\"hero3d\">\n      <div class=\"h3d-stage\" data-stage></div>\n      <div class=\"say h3d-say\" data-say hidden><b data-say-who>Hunter</b><span data-say-text></span></div>\n      <div class=\"h3d-picks\"><button type=\"button\" data-pick=\"copy\">Copy</button><button type=\"button\" data-pick=\"sniper\">Sniper</button><button type=\"button\" data-pick=\"hunter\">Hunter</button><button type=\"button\" data-pick=\"guard\">Guard</button><button type=\"button\" data-pick=\"scout\">Scout</button></div>\n      <form class=\"talk h3d-talk\" data-talk autocomplete=\"off\"><input maxlength=\"600\" placeholder=\"Write to Hunter…\" aria-label=\"Write to Hunter\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button class=\"btn ink\" type=\"submit\">Send</button></form>\n      <div id=\"world\" class=\"world\" hidden></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-stats wrap\" id=\"live\">\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Squads awake</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0</div><div class=\"s\">signed in</div></div>\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Copies filled</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0</div><div class=\"s\">on the live market</div></div>\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Launches</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0</div><div class=\"s\">in the last 2 h</div></div>\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Paid back</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0</div><div class=\"s\">SOL to holders</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tape\" aria-label=\"What squads are doing right now\">\n      <div class=\"tape-k\"><span class=\"led\"></span><span class=\"wide-only\">Squads, right now</span><span class=\"phone-only\">Live</span></div>\n      <div class=\"tape-run\"><div class=\"tape-track\" id=\"tape\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- proof of speed: the demo wallet's real trades, every slot checked on chain (public/js/proof.js, /api/proof) -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec proof-sec\" id=\"speed\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><div class=\"kicker\"><b>Proof</b> · on chain, check it yourself</div><h2>Our speed, <em>on chain.</em></h2></div><span class=\"more\" id=\"proof-wallet\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"proof\" id=\"proof\"><div class=\"proof-empty skeleton\" style=\"height:180px\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 01 · character select: each pip on its own station -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec reveal\" id=\"squad\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><div class=\"kicker\"><b>01</b> · The squad</div><h2>Five pips. <em>One job each.</em></h2></div></div>\n    <div class=\"select\" id=\"select\">\n      <div class=\"select-stage\">\n        <div class=\"select-art\" id=\"sel-art\"></div>\n        <div class=\"select-card\" id=\"sel-card\">\n          <div class=\"role-k\" id=\"sel-k\">Finds</div>\n          <h3 id=\"sel-name\">Hunter</h3>\n          <p id=\"sel-what\"></p>\n          <ul id=\"sel-does\"></ul>\n          <div class=\"select-foot\"><span class=\"live\" id=\"sel-live\"><i></i>—</span><a class=\"btn sm\" id=\"sel-go\" href=\"/hunter\">Open the desk →</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"select-tabs\" id=\"sel-tabs\" role=\"tablist\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 02 · the product moment: say it, approve it, watch it -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec reveal\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><div class=\"kicker\"><b>02</b> · How it works</div><h2>Say it. <em>Approve it.</em> Watch it.</h2></div><a class=\"more\" href=\"/docs\">The details →</a></div>\n    <div class=\"moment\">\n      <div class=\"frame\">\n        <div class=\"frame-n\">1</div><div class=\"frame-t\">Say what you want</div>\n        <div class=\"frame-body chatlet\">\n          <div class=\"b me\">copy the top 10 hunter wallets with 0.1 sol</div>\n          <div class=\"b them\"><img src=\"/art/pip-hunter.png\" alt=\"\">Made a card: 10 wallets, 0.1 SOL a copy, launch buys only, out at 2x / −50 % / 1 h. Switch it on when you're ready.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"frame\">\n        <div class=\"frame-n\">2</div><div class=\"frame-t\">Approve the card</div>\n        <div class=\"frame-body\">\n          <div class=\"cardlet\">\n            <div class=\"cardlet-h\"><img src=\"/art/pip-copy.png\" alt=\"\"><b>Copy · Hunter top 10</b><span class=\"switch demo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div>\n            <dl><dt>Wallets</dt><dd>10</dd><dt>Size</dt><dd>0.1 SOL a copy</dd><dt>Only</dt><dd>launch buys ≤ 3 s</dd><dt>Exits</dt><dd>2x · −50 % · 1 h</dd><dt>Runs</dt><dd>by itself</dd></dl>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"frame\">\n        <div class=\"frame-n\">3</div><div class=\"frame-t\">Watch it work</div>\n        <div class=\"frame-body evlist\">\n          <div class=\"ev\"><img src=\"/art/pip-copy.png\" alt=\"\"><span>Copied a launch buy with 0.1 SOL, <b>1 slot</b> after theirs.</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ev\"><img src=\"/art/pip-guard.png\" alt=\"\"><span>Reached 2x. The Guard took the exit.</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ev\"><img src=\"/art/pip-guard.png\" alt=\"\"><span>Closed: <b class=\"good\">+0.094 SOL</b> after costs.</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"moment-note\">An example of the flow. Get your squad a Pips wallet (or bring your own), fund it, approve a card: the squad trades and shows the slot every fill landed in. Withdraw or export the key whenever you want, each time confirmed with your own Phantom.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 03 · the bots: the same squad in Telegram and Discord (the picture is the bot's own, bots/lib/card.mjs, for a live coin) -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec reveal\" id=\"bots\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><div class=\"kicker\"><b>03</b> · Telegram and Discord</div><h2>Your squad, <em>in your chats.</em></h2></div><a class=\"more\" href=\"/docs#bots\">Every command →</a></div>\n    <div class=\"bots\">\n      <figure class=\"bots-shot\">\n        <div class=\"bots-msg\"><code>HaQdrXRUoxxk1qLFZJNrSyzWNjn16o1r1np5h6jipump</code></div>\n        <img src=\"/art/bot-scout-card.jpg\" alt=\"The Scout's read of a coin as the bot posts it: the dev's launches, the launch slot, the top 10 holders, the cap and its chart\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <div class=\"bots-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Buy 0.1</span><span>Buy 0.5</span><span>Buy 1</span><span>Buy X</span></div>\n        <figcaption>Paste a coin address: the Scout answers with its read and four Buy buttons. The buy goes out from your squad wallet.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"bots-side\">\n        <div class=\"botc tg\">\n          <div class=\"botc-h\"><span class=\"botc-ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></span><div><b>Telegram</b><span>@GetPipsBot</span></div></div>\n          <ul class=\"botc-cmds\">\n            <li><code>/snipe &lt;dev&gt; 0.2</code><span>buys that dev's next launch</span></li>\n            <li><code>/copy &lt;wallet&gt; 0.1</code><span>copies that wallet's launch buys</span></li>\n            <li><code>/buy &lt;coin&gt; 0.5</code><span>buys now</span></li>\n            <li><code>/positions</code><span>open trades, with Sell 25 / 50 / 100 %</span></li>\n            <li><code>/alerts on</code><span>fills, exits and the Guard's alarms as they happen</span></li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>In a group, <code>/check &lt;coin&gt;</code> posts the Scout's read for everyone. Trading stays in your private chat.</p>\n          <div class=\"row\"><a class=\"btn ink\" href=\"https://t.me/GetPipsBot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open @GetPipsBot</a></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"botc dc\">\n          <div class=\"botc-h\"><span class=\"botc-ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></span><div><b>Discord</b><span>Pips</span></div></div>\n          <p>The same commands as slash commands. In a server, <code>/check</code> works in every channel; buys, snipes and copies happen in your DMs with the bot.</p>\n          <div class=\"row\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1559500936936955974&amp;scope=bot%20applications.commands&amp;permissions=2147601408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Add to your server</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1559500936936955974&amp;integration_type=1&amp;scope=applications.commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Add to your account</a></div>\n          <a class=\"botc-join\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Xxwv2ktGR6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Join the Pips server: the squad feed, guides and support →</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"moment-note\">Link a chat to your squad once: on the Wallet page press Link Telegram or Link Discord, then send the bot <code>/link CODE</code>. The bot trades from the same squad wallet, with the same cards, as the site. Withdrawals and key export stay on the site, confirmed with Phantom.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 04 · the Hunter's best find, as a dossier -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec reveal\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><div class=\"kicker\"><b>04</b> · The Hunter's best find right now</div><h2>Who is worth following, <em>with the receipts.</em></h2></div><a class=\"more\" href=\"/hunter\">The whole list →</a></div>\n    <div class=\"dossier\" id=\"best\">\n      <div class=\"dossier-top\">\n        <img src=\"/art/pip-hunter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"58\" height=\"58\">\n        <div class=\"who\"><div class=\"kicker\" id=\"best-k\">Launch buyer</div><div class=\"addr\" id=\"best-w\"><span class=\"skeleton\" style=\"\"></span></div></div>\n        <a class=\"btn ink\" id=\"best-go\" href=\"/hunter\">See the evidence</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dossier-body\">\n        <div class=\"dossier-num\">\n          <div class=\"kicker\">Per 1-SOL copy</div>\n          <div class=\"big skeleton\" id=\"best-v\"><span class=\"n\">+0.00</span><span class=\"u\">SOL</span></div>\n          <p>Copying its launch buys with 1 SOL each, filled one slot after theirs, after every cost.</p>\n          <dl class=\"receipt\" id=\"best-rc\">\n            <div><dt>Total, 21 days</dt><dd>—</dd></div>\n            <div><dt>Best copy</dt><dd>—</dd></div>\n            <div><dt>Worst copy</dt><dd>—</dd></div>\n            <div><dt>Its buy lands</dt><dd>—</dd></div>\n          </dl>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sc res best-res\" id=\"best-chart\"><div class=\"sc-empty skeleton\">reading its copies…</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cells\" id=\"best-facts\">\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Copies</div><div class=\"v\">—</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Reached 2x</div><div class=\"v\">—</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Rugs</div><div class=\"v\">—</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Active</div><div class=\"v\">—</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 05 · make them yours: the 25 shapes -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec reveal\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><div class=\"kicker\"><b>05</b> · Make them yours</div><h2>Five shapes. <em>Any colour.</em> Your names.</h2></div><a class=\"more\" href=\"/squad\">Dress your squad →</a></div>\n    <div class=\"shapes\" id=\"shapes\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 06 · holders -->\n  <section class=\"wrap sec reveal\">\n    <div class=\"payback\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\"><b>06</b> · $PIPS holders</div>\n      <h2>Every hour, fees buy back <em>$PIPS for holders.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"flow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"node\"><span>Every trade</span><b>the squad makes</b></div>\n        <i class=\"wire\"></i>\n        <div class=\"node amber\"><span id=\"f-fee\">1 % fee</span><b id=\"f-hold\">free if you hold 1M+ $PIPS</b></div>\n        <i class=\"wire\"></i>\n        <div class=\"node\"><span id=\"f-share\">Buy back $PIPS</span><b>50 % of the fees + 50 % of the creator fees</b></div>\n        <i class=\"wire\"></i>\n        <div class=\"node\"><span id=\"f-every\">Every 60 min</span><b>sent to holders, pro rata</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cells\" id=\"money\">\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Fees</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0.000</div><div class=\"s\">SOL</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Holders' half</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0.000</div><div class=\"s\">SOL</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Paid back</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0.000</div><div class=\"s\">SOL</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Holders paid</div><div class=\"v skeleton\">0</div><div class=\"s\">wallets</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fees\">The ledger</a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/risk\">The risks</a></div>\n      <p class=\"risk-line\">Copying and sniping memecoins loses money more often than not. The Hunter shows what its picks did on weeks it never saw, including when that is little.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"site-foot\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cols\">\n      <div><div class=\"brandline\">Your own trading squad.</div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"\">Five pips on your side of the trench: they find, copy, snipe and guard, and you approve every move.</p></div>\n      <div><h4>Squad</h4><a href=\"/squad\">My squad</a><a href=\"https://scope.getpips.xyz\">PIPScope</a><a href=\"/hunter\">Hunter</a><a href=\"/copy\">Copy</a><a href=\"/snipes\">Snipes</a><a href=\"/guard\">Guard</a><a href=\"/scout\">Scout</a></div>\n      <div><h4>Money</h4><a href=\"/wallet\">Wallet</a><a href=\"/grind\">Grind a PiPS wallet</a><a href=\"/fees\">Fees and payback</a><a href=\"/status\">Status</a></div>\n      <div><h4>Chats</h4><a href=\"https://t.me/GetPipsBot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telegram: @GetPipsBot</a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Xxwv2ktGR6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Pips Discord</a><a href=\"https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1559500936936955974&amp;scope=bot%20applications.commands&amp;permissions=2147601408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Add Pips to a server</a></div>\n      <div><h4>Read</h4><a href=\"/docs\">Docs</a><a href=\"/terms\">Terms</a><a href=\"/risk\">Risk</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a></div>\n      <div id=\"foot-follow\"><h4>$PIPS</h4><a href=\"https://x.com/pipsonsol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" id=\"foot-x\">Follow @pipsonsol</a><span class=\"ca-line\" id=\"foot-ca\"><b>$PIPS</b> soon on pump.fun</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"fine\">Pips is software that follows rules you approve; it is not financial advice. Memecoins are extremely risky and most go to zero. Past results are not future results.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"giant\" aria-hidden=\"true\">pips</div>\n</footer>\n</body></html>\n",
